    "description": "You are purchasing a \"VTG Lot New/Sealed & Open Blank 8-Track Tapes & Some Pop Seals & Crofts Xmas \" in \"Used\" condition.\nLot of vintage 8-track stereo tapes and blank cartridges, perfect for collectors, retro audio fans, or display in a classic music room. This mixed lot includes various artists plus a stack of sealed blank 8-track cartridges. Several music titles are still in their original wrap, with others showing that great vintage patina—worn edges, creases, and rubbed corners that tell their age and history. The sealed blanks are ideal if you like recording your own mixes on original-format media. Whether you’re rebuilding a vintage 8-track collection, looking for period-correct decor, or just love old-school audio, this bundle gives you a nice mix of titles and blanks in one shot. Keywords: 8-track tapes, 8 track lot, vintage 8 track cartridges, blank 8 track, retro audio, classic rock 8 track, tape cartridge lot, collectible music tapes\nLot of vintage 8-track stereo tapes and blank cartridges. Several music tapes remain factory wrapped in shrink with varying edge wear, creases, and scuffing to the outer cardboard sleeves. Some open tapes show worn corners, surface scratches, rubbing, and small tears on the boxes and labels. Plastic cartridge shells show handling wear but no obvious cracks or missing pieces. The stack of blank 8-track 40 cartridges appears sealed with outer wrap showing light wrinkles and shelf wear. There is some wear and soiling. Untested, sold as is.\nCondition Notes:\nLot of vintage 8-track stereo tapes and blank cartridges. Several music tapes remain factory wrapped in shrink with varying edge wear, creases, and scuffing to the outer cardboard sleeves. Some open tapes show worn corners, surface scratches, rubbing, and small tears on the boxes and labels. Plastic cartridge shells show handling wear but no obvious cracks or missing pieces. The stack of blank 8-track 40 cartridges appears sealed with outer wrap showing light wrinkles and shelf wear. There is some wear and soiling. Untested, sold as is.\nAspects:\nItem Weight: 7 lb",
